---
id: about
displayOrder: 1
---
{% import "../include/page-components/parts.html" as insert %}
{% import "../include/page-components/accordion.html" as acc %}
<!-- About Section -->
<section id="about">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="row">

      <div class="col-lg-9 order-1 order-lg-2">
        <div class="about-story">

          <div class="copy-wrapper">
            {{insert.pageHeading("", "Rob Wood", "", "", "Full Stack Engineer")}}
            <p class="subtitle">Senior Engineering Leader | Principal Systems Architect | Transformation Specialist</p>
            <p class="subtitle2">Realizing the Promise of Technology Through Cost-Effective Measurable Outcomes</p>
          </div>

          <div class="copy-wrapper">
            <h3><b>Executive</b> Summary</h3>
            <p>
              I work at the intersection of engineering execution, systems architecture, and organizational improvement.
            </p>
            <p>
              I help organizations recover momentum when technology becomes a blocker.
            </p>
          </div>
          <details class="read-more">
            <summary>
              {% icon "expand", '{ "width": "16", "height": "16" }' %}
              <span class="closed">More... (click to expand details)</span>
              <span class="open">Less... (click to close details)</span>
            </summary>

            <div class="copy-wrapper">
              <p class="copy-section">
                That usually means stepping into environments where the technology is underperforming, the delivery process is noisy, or the business has outgrown the way the software was originally built.
              </p>
              <p class="copy-section">
                I help teams regain control by clarifying the technical path, fixing structural problems, and improving the way software gets delivered.
              </p>
              <p class="copy-section">
                Over the past 20+ years, I have modernized legacy products, rescued fragile systems, improved cloud foundations, and helped teams work with more speed and less noise.
              </p>
              <p class="copy-section">
                My background spans hands-on engineering, architecture, platform work, and leadership, which makes me effective in situations where technical problems are tightly coupled to process and organizational drag.
              </p>
              <p class="copy-section">
                My work has included stabilizing critical systems for companies such as Netflix and Sunrun, supporting nationally visible public-sector platforms, and helping turn internal tools into revenue-generating products.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <div class="expertise-grid copy-wrapper">
            <h3><b>Signature Strengths</b> & Strategic Competencies</h3>
            {{ acc.accordion(competencies)  }}
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-3 order-2 order-lg-1">

        <div class="profile-image">

          <div class="profile-image-container">
            <img src="../../../img/profile/working-at-workstation.png" class="img-fluid" alt="Rob Wood working at computer workstation">
          </div>

          <div class="profile-meta">
            <div class="location">
              {% icon "location", '{ "width": "16", "height": "16" }' %}
              <span>Escanaba, MI</span>
            </div>
            <div class="status">
              <div class="status-indicator"></div>
              <span>Available for permanent roles, fractional support, consulting, and contract engagements.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="philosophy-quote">
          <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
          <p>With the advent of AI, <b>code is commoditized, but strategy isn’t</b>. Code velocity alone doesn’t create strategy, protect culture, or build resilience. <b>The real ROI comes from your people - not the tool</b>.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-12">
        <div class="section-heading-alt about-2">
          {{insert.pageHeading("", "Let's Make", "", "", "Some Changes!", "")}}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row align-items-start">
      <div class="col-lg-5 image-col">
        <div class="about-image">
          <div class="image-wrapper">
            <img src="../../../img/profile/business-conference.png" alt="Rob Wood seated in a business conference"
            class="img-fluid main-image">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row actions about-btns">
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <a href="#portfolio" class="btn btn-secondary">
              <span>View Portfolio</span>
              {% icon "portfolio", '{ "width": "18", "height": "18" }' %}
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">
              <span>Start a Project</span>
              {% icon "speech-bubble-square", '{ "width": "18", "height": "18" }' %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-7 collab-text animate-section">
        <div class="about-img-2">
          <div class="column left">
            <img width="324" height="324" class="center-float" src="../../../img/profile/standup-circle.png" alt="Rob Wood leading a daily standup.">
            <div class="adjustment">
              <h3><b>How I can help</b> your business/team</h3>
              <p>Discover or recover direction.  I align systems and teams with best practices and business goals, delivering more effective and efficient processes and happier,more productive developers. If you need a staff engineer or technical leader who can step into ambiguity, untangle complexity, and create forward motion, that is the work I do best.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column right">
            <div class="center-float" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="adjustment">
              <h3><b>Contact me now</b><br> - let's get started!</h3>
              <p>Tech should be a force multiplier, not a blocker, a time sink, a mystery, or a money pit. I use my extensive and diverse experience in business and technology to produce fully integrated and observable systems that deliver measurable business value. Let's talk about how to affordably optimize your systems to eliminate problems and maximize your ROI!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="copy-wrapper">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary about-2">
            <span>Contact Me</span>
            {% icon "speech-bubble-square", '{ "width": "16", "height": "16" }' %}
          </a>
          <h3><b>What I bring</b><br>to projects and teams</h3>
          <p>
            Immediate results. I employ a pragmatic, no-nonsense approach that produces fast understanding, honest diagnosis, practical execution, and meaningful improvement without unnecessary churn.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>
<!-- /About Section -->
